MINION 3
#TEST SOLCOUNT 0
# The watchsumleq half of the same propagator (BoolLessSumConstraintDynamic
# with VarToCount = 1). x + !x is always 1, so requiring the sum to be at
# most 0 is unsatisfiable; the same skipped force-assign reported a
# solution.

**VARIABLES**

BOOL x

**SEARCH**

PRINT [[x]]

**CONSTRAINTS**

watchsumleq([x, !x], 0)

**EOF**
